-- Chapter 1 (CHƯƠNG 1), Articles 1 and 2: the definitions and the Contract.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/manulife-group-linked.txt;
-- a `src:N-M | …` line quotes the first line of a range and stands for the whole range.
--
-- Most of Article 1 names things (the nouns module declares them). What follows encodes the
-- definitions that compute: the Age, the dates of Article 1.9, the premium and account-value
-- arithmetic of 1.12-1.25, and the two qualification tests 1.2 and 1.4.

§ `Chapter 1 — General provisions`
-- src:5 | CHƯƠNG 1  NHỮNG QUY ĐỊNH
-- src:6 | CHUNG

§§ `Refusals this module gives`

-- A date before the Coverage Start Date has no insurance year: Article 1.9.7 starts counting
-- at the Coverage Start Date.
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the document defines no insurance year before the Coverage Start Date` MEANS
    REFUSE "the document defines no insurance year before the Coverage Start Date (1.9.7)"

§§ `Article 1.2 — who qualifies as the Policyholder`

-- src:25-31 | Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm: là (i) tổ chức được thành lập hợp…
@ref Article 1.2 (src:25-31)
GIVEN p IS A `The Policyholder's particulars`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`1.2 — qualifies as the Policyholder` p MEANS
        "(i)"  ... p's `an organisation lawfully established in Vietnam`
               ... NOT p's `established for the sole purpose of buying insurance`
    AND "(ii)" ... p's `declared and signed the Application`
               ... p's `recorded as Policyholder on the Contract Page, a Certificate or an Endorsement`

§§ `Article 1.8 — the Age`

-- "the age of the Insured Member at the birthday nearest before (i) the Coverage Start Date
-- or (ii) the Policy Anniversary in later insurance years". The source numbers both limbs
-- "(ii)" (src:70-71): a typo, NOTES.md finding X26.
-- src:69 | Tuổi: là tuổi của Người Được Bảo Hiểm tính theo ngày
-- src:70 | sinh nhật gần nhất trước (ii) Ngày Bắt Đầu Bảo Hiểm hoặc
-- src:71 | (ii) Ngày Kỷ Niệm Năm trong các Năm Bảo Hiểm tiếp theo.
-- Fork F1: a birthday falling ON the reference date counts ("age last birthday"); the strict
-- reading of "trước" (before) would make the Age one less on that day only.
@ref Article 1.8 (src:69-71)
GIVEN `reference date` IS A DATE
      `date of birth` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Age, as at` `reference date` `, of a person born on` `date of birth` MEANS
    IF   `add years` `date of birth` `year difference` AT MOST `reference date`
    THEN `year difference`
    ELSE `year difference` MINUS 1
    WHERE
        `year difference` MEANS DATE_YEAR `reference date` MINUS DATE_YEAR `date of birth`

-- 1.4(i) counts from "01 (một) tháng tuổi": an age in completed months.
@ref Article 1.4(i) (src:42)
GIVEN `reference date` IS A DATE
      `date of birth` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the age in completed months, as at` `reference date` `, of a person born on` `date of birth` MEANS
    IF   `add months` `date of birth` `month difference` AT MOST `reference date`
    THEN `month difference`
    ELSE `month difference` MINUS 1
    WHERE
        `month difference` MEANS
                (DATE_YEAR `reference date` MINUS DATE_YEAR `date of birth`) TIMES 12
            PLUS DATE_MONTH `reference date` MINUS DATE_MONTH `date of birth`

§§ `Article 1.4 — who qualifies as an Insured Member`

-- All four conditions, "vào thời điểm yêu cầu bảo hiểm" (at the time of the request for
-- insurance). Fork F2: the Age in (i) is taken as at the date the particulars describe (the
-- request), by the 1.8 method; 1.8 itself fixes the Age at the Coverage Start Date.
-- src:37-47 | Người Được Bảo Hiểm: là người mà tính mạng và/…
-- src:41 | tất cả các điều kiện sau vào thời điểm yêu cầu bảo hiểm:
-- src:42 | (i) trong độ Tuổi từ 01 (một) tháng tuổi đến 65 (sáu
-- src:43 | mươi lăm) tuổi, và
-- src:44 | (ii) đang hiện diện tại Việt Nam, và
-- src:45 | (iii) có Đơn Đăng Ký Người Được Bảo Hiểm hợp lệ, và
-- src:46 | (iv) phí bảo hiểm tương ứng với Người Được Bảo Hiểm
-- src:47 | đó đã được nộp cho Công Ty.
-- 1.4(i), which 6.1 and 6.2 also apply ("nhóm tuổi được bảo hiểm", the insurable ages):
-- from one month old to 65, both ends included.
@ref Article 1.4(i) (src:42-43)
GIVEN `reference date` IS A DATE
      `date of birth` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`1.4(i) — as at` `reference date` `, a person born on` `date of birth` `is within the insurable ages` MEANS
        `the age in completed months, as at` `reference date` `, of a person born on` `date of birth` AT LEAST 1
    AND `the Age, as at` `reference date` `, of a person born on` `date of birth` AT MOST 65

@ref Article 1.4 (src:37-47)
GIVEN p IS A `The person's particulars`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` p MEANS
        p's `recorded in the List of Insured Members`
    AND "(i)"   ... `1.4(i) — as at` (p's `as at`) `, a person born on` (p's `date of birth`) `is within the insurable ages`
    AND "(ii)"  ... p's `present in Vietnam`
    AND "(iii)" ... p's `holds a valid Enrolment Form`
    AND "(iv)"  ... p's `premium for this person paid to the Company`

§§ `Article 1.9 — the dates`

-- 1.9.3 and 1.9.5: the monthly anniversaries of the Contract Effective Date and of the
-- Coverage Start Date. "Where the month has no corresponding day, the day immediately before
-- applies." `add months` clamps to the last day of the month, which is where repeatedly taking
-- "the day before" a missing day lands (fork F4).
-- src:82-85 | 1.9.3 Ngày Kỷ Niệm Tháng Hợp Đồng: là ngày…
-- src:92-95 | 1.9.5 Ngày Kỷ Niệm Tháng: là ngày tương ứng…
@ref Articles 1.9.3 and 1.9.5 (src:82-85, 92-95)
GIVEN k IS A NUMBER
      `the base date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the Monthly Anniversary number` k `of` `the base date` MEANS
    `add months` `the base date` k

-- 1.9.6: "If the year has no such day, the last day of that month applies" (29 February).
-- src:96-99 | 1.9.6 Ngày Kỷ Niệm Năm: là ngày tương ứng hàng…
@ref Article 1.9.6 (src:96-99)
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      `the coverage start date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the Policy Anniversary number` n `of` `the coverage start date` MEANS
    `add years` `the coverage start date` n

-- 1.9.7: an insurance year runs from the Coverage Start Date (or a Policy Anniversary) to the
-- next Policy Anniversary. Insurance year n holds the dates from anniversary n-1 up to, but
-- not including, anniversary n.
-- src:103-108 | 1.9.7 Năm Bảo Hiểm: là khoảng thời gian một năm…
@ref Article 1.9.7 (src:103-108)
GIVEN `the coverage start date` IS A DATE
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the insurance year, under a cover starting` `the coverage start date` `, in which falls` d MEANS
    IF   d BELOW `the coverage start date`
    THEN `the document defines no insurance year before the Coverage Start Date`
    ELSE 1 PLUS `the Age, as at` d `, of a person born on` `the coverage start date`

-- 1.9.8: a Premium Year is an insurance year in which every Basic Premium due is paid in full.
-- src:109-112 | 1.9.8 Năm Phí Bảo Hiểm: là một Năm Bảo Hiểm mà…
@ref Article 1.9.8 (src:109-112)
GIVEN `every basic premium due in the insurance year was paid in full` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`1.9.8 — the insurance year is a Premium Year` `every basic premium due in the insurance year was paid in full` MEANS
    `every basic premium due in the insurance year was paid in full`

-- The anchor that 7.1, 12.1 and 15(a) all count from: the Coverage Start Date or the latest
-- reinstatement date, "whichever is later".
@ref Articles 7.1 (src:483-486), 12.1 (src:710-713), 15(a) (src:785-787)
GIVEN part IS AN `An Insured Member's part`
GIVETH A DATE
`the later of the Coverage Start Date and the latest reinstatement date of` part MEANS
    CONSIDER part's `latest reinstatement date`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN part's `coverage start date`
    WHEN JUST r  THEN IF   r AT LEAST part's `coverage start date`
                      THEN r
                      ELSE part's `coverage start date`

§§ `Articles 1.12 to 1.18 — premiums and charges`

-- 1.12: the Periodic Premium is the sum of the Basic Premium and the Rider Premium.
-- src:130-133 | 1.12 Phí Bảo Hiểm Định Kỳ: là tổng các: (i) khoản phí…
@ref Article 1.12 (src:130-137)
GIVEN `basic premium` IS A NUMBER
      `rider premium` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.12 — the Periodic Premium, of a basic premium` `basic premium` `and a rider premium` `rider premium` MEANS
    `basic premium` PLUS `rider premium`

-- 1.14 with 1.15 and 25.1: the Allocated Premium is what remains of the Basic Premium and
-- the Top-up Premium after the Initial Charge. The Initial Charge rate is set per Premium Year
-- on the Contract Page (25.1): an input.
-- src:142 | 1.14 Phí Bảo Hiểm Được Phân Bổ: là phần còn lại của Phí
-- src:143 | Bảo Hiểm Cơ Bản và/hoặc Phí Bảo Hiểm Đóng Thêm sau
-- src:144 | khi khấu trừ Phí Ban Đầu.
@ref Articles 1.14, 1.15 and 25.1 (src:142-150, 1278-1286)
GIVEN `basic premium paid` IS A NUMBER
      `top-up premium paid` IS A NUMBER
      `initial charge rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.14 — the Allocated Premium, of` `basic premium paid` `basic and` `top-up premium paid` `top-up at an initial charge rate of` `initial charge rate` MEANS
    (`basic premium paid` PLUS `top-up premium paid`) TIMES (1 MINUS `initial charge rate`)

-- 1.18: the Monthly Deduction is the Cost of Insurance plus the Policy Administration Charge.
-- src:183-186 | Khoản Khấu Trừ Hàng Tháng: là khoản tiền được…
@ref Article 1.18 (src:183-186)
GIVEN `cost of insurance` IS A NUMBER
      `policy administration charge` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.18 — the Monthly Deduction, of` `cost of insurance` `and` `policy administration charge` MEANS
    `cost of insurance` PLUS `policy administration charge`

§§ `Articles 1.21 to 1.25 — Debt and the account values`

-- 1.21: all Debt "will be deducted by the Company before paying any insurance benefit".
-- src:200 | Đồng. Tất cả các khoản tiền này sẽ được coi là còn nợ
-- src:201 | Công Ty và sẽ được Công Ty khấu trừ trước khi thanh
-- src:202 | toán bất kỳ quyền lợi bảo hiểm nào theo Hợp Đồng này.
@ref Article 1.21 (src:195-202)
GIVEN `benefit` IS A NUMBER
      `debt` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.21 — the benefit` `benefit` `less Debt of` `debt` MEANS
    `benefit` MINUS `debt`

-- 1.22: the Account Value is the sum of the two account values.
-- src:203 | Giá Trị Tài Khoản: là tổng (i) Giá Trị Tài Khoản Của Bên
-- src:204 | Mua Bảo Hiểm và (ii) Giá Trị Tài Khoản Của Người Được
-- src:205 | Bảo Hiểm.
@ref Article 1.22 (src:203-211)
GIVEN a IS A `The accounts`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.22 — the Account Value of` a MEANS
    a's `the Policyholder's account value` PLUS a's `the Insured Member's account value`

-- 1.22, second and third paragraphs: each account is built from the Allocated Premium "by the
-- contribution ratio" of the Policyholder and of the Insured Member.
-- src:206-211 | Giá Trị Tài Khoản Của Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm được xác…
@ref Article 1.22 (src:206-211)
GIVEN `allocated premium` IS A NUMBER
      `the Policyholder's contribution ratio` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member`
`1.22 — the Allocated Premium` `allocated premium` `split at a Policyholder contribution ratio of` `the Policyholder's contribution ratio` MEANS
    `A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH
        `to the Policyholder`   IS `allocated premium` TIMES `the Policyholder's contribution ratio`
        `to the Insured Member` IS `allocated premium` TIMES (1 MINUS `the Policyholder's contribution ratio`)

-- 1.23: the Surrender Value is the Account Value less the Termination Charge.
-- src:212 | Giá Trị Hoàn Lại: là giá trị thu được sau khi lấy Giá Trị
-- src:213 | Tài Khoản trừ đi Phí Chấm Dứt.
@ref Article 1.23 (src:212-213)
GIVEN a IS A `The accounts`
      `termination charge` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.23 — the Surrender Value of` a `with a termination charge of` `termination charge` MEANS
    `1.22 — the Account Value of` a MINUS `termination charge`

-- 1.24: the Net Cash Value is the Surrender Value less any Debt.
-- src:214 | Giá Trị Tiền Mặt Thực Trả: là giá trị thu được sau khi
-- src:215 | lấy Giá Trị Hoàn Lại trừ đi các khoản Nợ (nếu có).
@ref Article 1.24 (src:214-215)
GIVEN a IS A `The accounts`
      `termination charge` IS A NUMBER
      `debt` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.24 — the Net Cash Value of` a `with a termination charge of` `termination charge` `and Debt of` `debt` MEANS
    `1.23 — the Surrender Value of` a `with a termination charge of` `termination charge` MINUS `debt`

-- 1.25: the Vested Account Value is the part of the Policyholder's account value the
-- Policyholder has vested in the Insured Member, at the ratio the Contract Page or the
-- Certificate records (fork F10).
-- src:216-222 | Giá Trị Tài Khoản Đã Trao Quyền Cho Người Được…
@ref Article 1.25 (src:216-222)
GIVEN a IS A `The accounts`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`1.25 — the Vested Account Value of` a MEANS
    a's `the Policyholder's account value` TIMES a's `the vesting ratio`

-- The split that 6.2(a), 10.2(a), 11.2(b), 13, 22 and 29 all print in the same words:
-- "(i) the Policyholder: the Policyholder's account value less the Vested Account Value;
-- and/or (ii) the Insured Member: the Insured Member's account value plus the Vested Account
-- Value." Quoted where it first appears, 6.2(a):
-- src:445-450 | (i) Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm: Giá Trị Tài Khoản Của Bên…
@ref Articles 6.2(a), 10.2(a), 11.2(b), 13, 22 (src:445-450, 575-581, 644-649, 734-740, 1123-1129)
GIVEN a IS A `The accounts`
GIVETH A `A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member`
`the account values, split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member, of` a MEANS
    `A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH
        `to the Policyholder`   IS a's `the Policyholder's account value` MINUS `1.25 — the Vested Account Value of` a
        `to the Insured Member` IS a's `the Insured Member's account value` PLUS `1.25 — the Vested Account Value of` a

§ `Article 2 — the insurance contract`
-- src:229 | ĐIỀU 2  HỢP ĐỒNG BẢO HIỂM

§§ `Article 2.1 and 2.2 — what the Contract consists of`

-- 2.1 lists the documents (declared in the nouns module as `A document of the Contract`);
-- 2.2 defines the Application, which the Policyholder declares, signs and lodges. Neither
-- states a rule beyond the definition: inert.
-- src:236-240 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm là thỏa thuận bằng văn bản giữa…
-- src:251-257 | Hồ Sơ Yêu Cầu Bảo Hiểm: là văn bản yêu cầu bảo…

§§ `Article 2.3 — changes take effect only by Endorsement`

-- src:258-261 | Tất cả các thay đổi hoặc bổ sung liên quan đến Hợp Đồng…
@ref Article 2.3 (src:258-261)
GIVEN `the Company has issued an Endorsement for the change` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`2.3 — a change to the Contract or to the Insured Members has effect` `the Company has issued an Endorsement for the change` MEANS
    `the Company has issued an Endorsement for the change`
